@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
actor "User" as U
component "Web Dashboard
(Next.js)" as UI
component "Forecasting API
(FastAPI)" as API
component "Inference Engine
(LSTM + Naive)" as INF
component "Training & Evaluation
(Modal + PyTorch)" as TRN
component "Model Artifacts
(checkpoint/scaler/splits/metrics)" as ART
database "UCI Data (Processed)
Parquet" as DATA

U --> UI : Select window, view charts
UI --> API : REST: /health /meta /test-windows /predict
API --> INF : Build window + infer
INF --> ART : Load model/scaler/splits
INF --> DATA : Read context + targets
API --> UI : Forecast, errors, summary
TRN --> DATA : Preprocess + split
TRN --> ART : Save models + metrics
TRN --> API : Deploy chosen artifacts
@enduml
